      "value": "@{5a51200eae715b48f1d1fccb|full_name}: vrchat devs can simply write down tag requirements. Example *Lewd can consist of abnormally defined sex appealed oragnals, and/or lack of skin coverage over them. This can also apply to any and all clothing/objects intended for sexual interests.* ~not much different to make then having a school dresscode.",
