  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Right now we cant tell if a lewd model has its appropriate Tag. If you see someone who has a questionable model you should be able to view their selected Tags to report them if the appropriate ones are un-applied. This should apply to all tag options and (i have not seen this as an option) set worlds to block a specifically Tagged model.\nThis should help keep the necessary social spaces as clean as can be.",
